PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "THE GRAND FINAL.\p"
    .string "I am LORELEI, the ELITE FOUR's\n"
    .string "first guard, and this year's wild\p"
    .string "card.\p"
    .string "No one outlasts me when it comes\n"
    .string "to icy POKéMON.\p"
    .string "The crowd is waiting. Are you\n"
    .string "ready?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Welcome to the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "I, LORELEI of the ELITE FOUR,\n"
    .string "have returned!\p"
    .string "You know how it goes.\n"
    .string "No one can best me when it comes\l"
    .string "to icy POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Freezing moves are powerful.\p"
    .string "Your POKéMON will be at my mercy\n"
    .string "when they are frozen solid.\p"
    .string "Hahaha!\n"
    .string "Are you ready?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "…Things shouldn't be this way!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "You're better than I thought.\n"
    .string "Go on ahead.\p"
    .string "You only got a taste of the\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE's power.$"


PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round0Intro::
    .string "POOL STAGE, MATCH 1 OF 5.\p"
    .string "PROF. SEKO: Even a professor enters\n"
    .string "the LEAGUE!\p"
    .string "Let me see what you have learned\n"
    .string "from your journey!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round0Defeat::
    .string "Remarkable! Your POKéMON have\ngrown so much!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round1Intro::
    .string "POOL STAGE, MATCH 2 OF 5.\p"
    .string "MAY: Hi! I trained all the way from\n"
    .string "HOENN for this!\p"
    .string "I will not go easy on you!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round1Defeat::
    .string "Wow, you are strong!\nI will train even harder!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round2Intro::
    .string "POOL STAGE, MATCH 3 OF 5.\p"
    .string "BRENDAN: So you are the one\n"
    .string "everyone is talking about.\p"
    .string "Let us see if the rumors are true!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round2Defeat::
    .string "Not bad at all.\nYou earned that win.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round3Intro::
    .string "POOL STAGE, MATCH 4 OF 5.\p"
    .string "GOLD: Finally, a worthy opponent!\p"
    .string "My partners and I have been\n"
    .string "waiting for this.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round3Defeat::
    .string "Ha! That was a good one!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round4Intro::
    .string "POOL STAGE, MATCH 5 OF 5.\p"
    .string "CRYSTAL: Last match of the pool!\p"
    .string "I am not here to lose.\n"
    .string "Let us fight with two POKéMON\lat once!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round4Defeat::
    .string "You are through.\nGood luck in the bracket!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round5Intro::
    .string "ROUND OF 16.\p"
    .string "LEAF: The bracket starts here.\p"
    .string "I have faced many TRAINERS, but\n"
    .string "I keep getting stronger.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round5Defeat::
    .string "I have no regrets.\nGo on ahead!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round6Intro::
    .string "QUARTER-FINAL.\p"
    .string "{RIVAL}: Well, well. You made it\n"
    .string "this far.\p"
    .string "I will not let my rival beat me\n"
    .string "in front of this crowd!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round6Defeat::
    .string "Tch... You really have\ngotten strong.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round7Intro::
    .string "SEMI-FINAL.\p"
    .string "BLUE: Smell that? The air of the\n"
    .string "real thing.\p"
    .string "I was CHAMPION once. Show me\n"
    .string "you deserve more than that!\p"
    .string "Two POKéMON each. Ready?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round7Defeat::
    .string "Hmph. Fine. You win this one.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round8Intro::
    .string "THE FINAL.\p"
    .string "N: I can hear your POKéMON.\p"
    .string "They trust you. Yet are you\n"
    .string "sure they are truly happy?\p"
    .string "Let me hear their answer!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Round8Defeat::
    .string "Their voices... they chose you.\nI understand now.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_NextMatch::
    .string "Well fought!\p"
    .string "The next match begins shortly.\n"
    .string "Recover your strength.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_TournamentWon::
    .string "The crowd roars!\p"
    .string "You are the winner of the\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE tournament!\p"
    .string "Now, the CHAMPION is waiting\n"
    .string "beyond the door.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder0Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 1 OF 13.\p"
    .string "LORELEI: The ice has not melted\n"
    .string "since you last came.\p"
    .string "Show me the CHAMPION's strength!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder0Defeat::
    .string "Still cold as ever...\nYou win.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder1Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 2 OF 13.\p"
    .string "BRUNO: Hoo! The CHAMPION returns!\p"
    .string "Let us see whose will is stronger!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder1Defeat::
    .string "Hah! My training was not enough!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder2Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 3 OF 13.\p"
    .string "AGATHA: Hee hee! Look at you, a\n"
    .string "CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "I have buried better TRAINERS!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder2Defeat::
    .string "Oh, you old rascal.\nYou win again.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder3Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 4 OF 13.\p"
    .string "LANCE: The dragons knew you would\n"
    .string "come back.\p"
    .string "Let me see how far you have grown.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder3Defeat::
    .string "Magnificent. Truly.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder4Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 5 OF 13.\p"
    .string "WILL: I saw your victory in dreams.\p"
    .string "Let me see if the dream was true.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder4Defeat::
    .string "The dream was true...$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder5Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 6 OF 13.\p"
    .string "KOGA: A ninja never loses twice.\p"
    .string "Yet I will gladly lose to a\n"
    .string "worthy foe.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder5Defeat::
    .string "Hmm. Admirable technique.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder6Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 7 OF 13.\p"
    .string "KAREN: Strong POKéMON, weak\n"
    .string "POKéMON... I do not care.\p"
    .string "Only the bond matters.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder6Defeat::
    .string "Your bond is real. Good.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder7Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 8 OF 13.\p"
    .string "SIDNEY: Ahahaha! A CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "I came all this way for a good\n"
    .string "fight. Do not disappoint me!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder7Defeat::
    .string "Ahaha! That was worth the trip!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder8Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 9 OF 13.\p"
    .string "PHOEBE: The spirits whisper your\n"
    .string "name, CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "Let us listen together.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder8Defeat::
    .string "The spirits are pleased.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder9Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 10 OF 13.\p"
    .string "GLACIA: I have waited a long time\n"
    .string "for a fight that burns.\p"
    .string "Melt me, if you can.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder9Defeat::
    .string "Finally... a fight that burns.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder10Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 11 OF 13.\p"
    .string "DRAKE: A true TRAINER treats\n"
    .string "POKéMON as equals.\p"
    .string "Show me that you do!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder10Defeat::
    .string "Well fought, TRAINER.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder11Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 12 OF 13.\p"
    .string "STEVEN: I collect stones. And I\n"
    .string "collect strong TRAINERS.\p"
    .string "You belong in both collections.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder11Defeat::
    .string "A battle to remember!$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder12Intro::
    .string "COUNCIL OF ELDERS, 13 OF 13.\p"
    .string "WALLACE: Beauty and strength, both.\p"
    .string "The last of the old guard\n"
    .string "stands before you.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Elder12Defeat::
    .string "Splendid! You are a true MASTER.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_NextElder::
    .string "Well fought!\p"
    .string "The next veteran steps forward.\n"
    .string "Recover your strength.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_ElderReward::
    .string "All thirteen veterans bow to you.\p"
    .string "You are the greatest of all\n"
    .string "the CHAMPIONS!\p"
    .string "Take this, as proof of their\n"
    .string "respect.$"

PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_ElderDone::
    .string "The old guard has nothing more\n"
    .string "to teach you, CHAMPION.$"
